Q5 (SQL). "Using users and call_waiter_requests, write a query to list waiters who resolved at least 5 alerts with an average response time under 10 seconds."
Answer:
SELECT 
    u.full_name AS waiter_name,
    COUNT(cwr.id) AS total_resolved,
    ROUND(AVG(cwr.response_seconds), 2) AS avg_response_sec
FROM call_waiter_requests cwr
INNER JOIN users u ON cwr.resolved_by = u.id
WHERE cwr.status = 'Resolved'
GROUP BY u.id, u.full_name
HAVING COUNT(cwr.id) >= 5 AND AVG(cwr.response_seconds) < 10.0
ORDER BY avg_response_sec ASC;

