Q6 (SQL). "Write an SQL query using LEFT JOIN to find all tables currently marked 'Eating' that do not yet have a 'Paid' bill."
Answer:
SELECT 
    rt.table_number,
    rt.status
FROM restaurant_tables rt
LEFT JOIN bills b 
    ON rt.id = b.table_id AND b.bill_status = 'Paid'
WHERE rt.status = 'Eating'
  AND b.id IS NULL;

